            "detailed_description": "Kofi Quest is a not-so-serious adventure that brings together mechanics from Action RPG and RTS games. You’ll control Kofi, a weak, lazy and unlucky videogame character that will be followed by a group of interesting (and pathetic) characters aiding him to live a great adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Videogame characters that know they’re videogame characters.<br></li><li>Mechanics from RTS, RPG and graphic adventure.<br></li><li>Explore Neighborwood and uncover loads of secrets.<br></li><li>Real-time combat similar to Action RPG’s with troops control.<br></li><li>Gear your troops up to achieve victory.<br></li><li>Troop Captains with special skills.<br></li><li>The story will immerse you in a comic adventure with tons of situations and characters.<br></li><li>Voice acting!<br></li><li>Cool soundtrack inpired by JRPG.<br></li><li>Your sword’s broken and your best friend’s a booger, but you can ride a direwolf.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/705340/extras/f87d6501303628d125f43c0cc20f4be0.avif?t=1685730414\" width=620 height=323 /></span>",
